  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SAFIRE (Southern Alliance for Indigenous Resources)  - Livelihoods Protection and Promotion Zimbabwe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SAFIRE and CAFOD are collaborating for the purpose of the Livelihoods Promotion and Protection Zimbabwe (LPPZ) in Manicaland, Matabeleland South and Matabeleland North Provinces, to enhance and diversify rural livelihood options for vulnerable rural households in the dry areas of Zimbabwe
The project aims to promote sustainable utilization and consumption of NTFP - based products by promoting and strengthening natural resource-based enterprises/IGAs. Market linkages between small holder farmers, private sector partners and agro service providers will be facilitated and strengthened.</narrative>
  </description>
